# Third-party software notices for the Zero app workspace

Zero's own code in `E:\zero\app` is a product of the Zero AI project.

## Native Control UI plugin (`zero-control-ui/`)

The plugin is Zero-authored plain DOM/ES modules. It does not embed React,
CopilotKit, AG-UI, OpenDots client code, or noVNC. It runs inside the OpenClaw
Control UI host and uses the plugin SDK contract.

## Gateway bridge library (`src/bridge/`)

- **OpenClaw** (`upstream/openclaw`, pinned commit
  `013240515205573248c27ab6b8eec7303f0da1a8`) — MIT License (OpenClaw
  Foundation) with `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. Re-used as npm packages
  `@openclaw/gateway-client@2026.10.6` and
  `@openclaw/gateway-protocol@2026.10.6` (exact pins, same release train as
  the backend's `openclaw@2026.10.6`). The device-pairing flow follows the
  Gateway client contract.

## Removed prototype dependencies

The earlier OpenDots-derived React client and its CopilotKit/AG-UI runtime were
removed on 2026-10-25. They are no longer installed, built, or shipped by this
workspace. Historical provenance remains in `REUSE-LEDGER.md` and
`reports/ui/` for audit purposes only.

